               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_62847808">2 bifolios with drafts for nos. 3-5  and 1 bifolio with sketches without text placed in a cover with richly decorated corners and title page. Written in ink. Paper: 17 staves and 14 staves. Heading on fol.1<rend xml:id="idm38" rend="sup">r</rend>: "<rend xml:id="idm39" rend="underline">Ali und Fatme</rend> / I. / <rend xml:id="idm40" rend="underline">Fatme am Brunnen</rend>. / Bilder des Orients / vom / H. Stieglitz."  Last 3 pages blank.</physMedium>
